The value of <m>D_{\hat{u}} f = u_1 + u_2</m> for <m>f(x,y)=\frac{x^2}{2}+\frac{y^2}{2}</m> as <m>\hat{u}</m> rotates around <m>P_0(1,1)</m>, with the special directions of Example III.
</caption>
